    "sections": {
        "description": "Legal Notary Firm is a structured and clean theme for professionals providing legal documentation and notary services consulting services. It offers a clear layout suitable for presenting services including document verification affidavit preparation legal consultation contracts certification and advising attorney, contracts, and certification services. The theme includes consulting corporation for service details, client information, appointment scheduling, and contact forms, helping visitors easily access important information. This theme can be used by notary governmental bodies, legal consultants, attorneys, law firms, documentation agencies, and legal service providers who need a professional website to display their services online. It also supports common website elements such as service pages, team profiles, testimonials, and business contact details. Using a responsive design and organized content layout, Legal Notary Firm enables legal professionals build a functional website for sharing legal services, handling client inquiries, and presenting notary-related information in a clear and accessible format."
    },
